---
layout: none
search: exclude
permalink: /search.json
---
{%- comment -%}
Search index for js/mtex-search.js.

One row per page: [title, url, folderIndex, description]. Arrays rather than
objects because the key names would otherwise repeat ~2700 times (~34 KB).

The description is the first paragraph after the <!--introduction--> marker that
MATLAB's publish emits. For function reference pages that is the purpose line of
the docstring ("smooth spatial EBSD"); for documentation pages it is the page
abstract. Do NOT key this on <!--/introduction--> instead: the two page families
use mixed layouts (some put the text inside the markers, most after), so that
rule silently misses most documentation pages.

page.content is rendered HTML on a clean build but raw source under
--incremental. This extraction is invariant to the difference: the generated
.html pages go through no converter, so Liquid is the only transform, and the
{% raw %}{% highlight %}{% endraw %} fences all sit after the first paragraph.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign folders = "function_reference,documentation,examples,workshops,other" | split: "," -%}
{%- assign sep = "" -%}
[
{%- for p in site.pages -%}
{%- if p.search == "exclude" or p.title == nil or p.title == "" -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign desc = "" -%}
{%- assign head = p.content | truncate: 4000, "" -%}
{%- if head contains "<!--introduction-->" -%}
{%- assign paras = head | split: "<!--introduction-->" | last | split: "<p>" -%}
{%- if paras.size > 1 -%}
{%- assign desc = paras[1] | split: "</p>" | first | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | strip | truncate: 200, "" -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- comment -%}
Four *Overview.html pages have a bare {% raw %}{% include inline_image.html %}{% endraw %} as their
first paragraph. Rendered it becomes an <img> and strips to nothing; unrendered
(--incremental) the Liquid source would survive as text. Dropping any candidate
that still holds a tag makes the index byte-identical either way.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign tag_open = "{" | append: "%" -%}
{%- assign var_open = "{" | append: "{" -%}
{%- if desc contains tag_open or desc contains var_open -%}
{%- assign desc = "" -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- if desc == "" and p.summary -%}
{%- assign desc = p.summary | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | strip | truncate: 200, "" -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign fi = 4 -%}
{%- for f in folders -%}{%- if f == p.folder -%}{%- assign fi = forloop.index0 -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
{{ sep }}[{{ p.title | strip | jsonify }},{{ p.url | jsonify }},{{ fi }},{{ desc | jsonify }}]
{%- assign sep = "," -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- for post in site.posts -%}
{%- if post.published == false -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign desc = post.excerpt | strip_html | normalize_whitespace | strip | truncate: 200, "" -%}
{{ sep }}[{{ post.title | strip | jsonify }},{{ post.url | jsonify }},4,{{ desc | jsonify }}]
{%- assign sep = "," -%}
{%- endfor -%}
]
